uv: Install python 1. # uv python list
uv: Install python 2. # uv python install <version>
uv: Install python 3. # uv python pin <version> --global
uv: Create a virtual environment and install all dependencies # uv sync
uv: Activate the virtual environment and execute a command # uv run <script> <flag>
uv: Install in development/editable mode # uv pip install -e .
uv: Initialize a project # uv init <project> --name <package> --python <version>
